00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,050
Section eleven.

2
00:00:03,316 --> 00:00:04,476
Memory and user authority.

3
00:00:05,723 --> 00:00:08,623
The purpose is to preserve useful state across changes.

4
00:00:10,169 --> 00:00:12,129
Here, memory means application records,

5
00:00:12,789 --> 00:00:15,789
not a model remembering a conversation or a LangChain

6
00:00:15,789 --> 00:00:17,369
conversation-memory component.

7
00:00:26,973 --> 00:00:27,413
Relationships,

8
00:00:28,213 --> 00:00:28,853
completed analysis,

9
00:00:29,573 --> 00:00:32,793
freshness, and review status answer different questions.

10
00:00:33,537 --> 00:00:36,957
A successful no-match is completed analysis.

11
00:00:37,981 --> 00:00:41,441
Removing Orion's Project can leave its Topic and Tags

12
00:00:41,441 --> 00:00:43,421
useful, while the receipt remains.

13
00:00:44,985 --> 00:00:48,445
Provider replay cache and optional run history are different

14
00:00:48,445 --> 00:00:48,905
records.

15
00:00:50,409 --> 00:00:53,409
Deleting one display or membership does not silently make

16
00:00:53,409 --> 00:00:56,469
the repository eligible for another paid decision.

17
00:01:02,010 --> 00:01:04,590
Accepting a proposal creates a user decision.

18
00:01:06,306 --> 00:01:09,646
Rejecting or removing a relationship leaves a protected tombstone.

19
00:01:10,982 --> 00:01:14,762
Approved rules can supply deterministic mappings, subject to those

20
00:01:14,762 --> 00:01:15,322
rejections.

21
00:01:16,818 --> 00:01:20,718
Ordinary organization cannot recreate a rejected edge behind the

22
00:01:20,718 --> 00:01:21,378
user's back.

23
00:01:22,114 --> 00:01:24,334
These protections preserve authority;

24
00:01:24,954 --> 00:01:28,374
they do not prove every accepted relationship was independently

25
00:01:28,374 --> 00:01:29,394
verified truth.

26
00:01:34,837 --> 00:01:38,357
Local reconciliation applies approved rules, compatible stored

27
00:01:38,357 --> 00:01:42,777
assignments, or contiguous name and alias matches for review.

28
00:01:44,226 --> 00:01:47,846
This match is stricter than retrieval's unordered alias tokens.

29
00:01:49,595 --> 00:01:53,335
Local suggestions have visible provenance and zero model

30
00:01:53,335 --> 00:01:53,835
confidence.

31
00:01:55,404 --> 00:01:57,484
They do not manufacture AI completion.

32
00:01:59,293 --> 00:02:02,853
Fresh analysis remains available with an explicit reason and

33
00:02:02,853 --> 00:02:05,533
reviewed budget when the user wants a new judgment.
